        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLG100SMTSS4, Delong Stainless Steel Door Pull with Hourglass Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1 inch diameter stainless steel door pull from First Impressions can be used in many applications such as residential front doors, commercial office entry doors, store front doors, or as an appliance handle. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, 36 inch, and 48 inch lengths. The Stainless Steel Delong Pull is made from long lasting stainless steel with brass hourglass-shaped mounts. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as a <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-stainless-steel-delong-pull-pair-first-impressions-pr-dlg100smtss4\"><b>Pair Back-to Back-Mounted</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Delong Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLG01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262301\"><b>First Impressions DLG100SMTSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DLG100012SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLG100024SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLG100036SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLG100048SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
