                "title": "Stainless Steel Delong Pull",
                "description": "This 1 inch diameter stainless steel door pull from First Impressions can be used in many applications such as residential front doors, commercial office entry doors, store front doors, or as an appliance handle. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, 36 inch, and 48 inch lengths. The Stainless Steel Delong Pull is made from long lasting stainless steel with brass hourglass-shaped mounts. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n",
